 ## Background
-The method is implemented in the **Nav3D** plugin for Unreal Engine 5, which provides true volumetric pathfinding and tactical reasoning using Sparse Voxel Octrees. The system is based on Daniel Brewer's "3D Flight Navigation Using Sparse Voxel Octrees" from *Game AI Pro 3*. It is used for AI agents navigating in 3D space, including flying units, swimming creatures, and zero-gravity environments [S2, unofficial].
